  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2308.11 Weekly Reports",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2308.11 Weekly Reports.\n\n(a) Each vessel agent shall mail a weekly report to the department and mail a copy to the tax collector of the municipality where the vessel agent is located.\n\n(b) Each vessel agent shall furnish the following on the weekly report:\n\n(1) Name of the city or town where the vessel agent is located;\n\n(2) Period the report begins and ends;\n\n(3) Number of vessels registered;\n\n(4) Amount of tax collected; and\n\n(5) Vessel agent’s signature.\n\n(c) The weekly report shall be submitted along with:\n\n(1) The department's copy of all registrations; and\n\n(2) All fees due to the department in the form of a check or money order.\n\nSource. #5283, eff 11-22-91; ss by #6616, eff 10-25-97, EXPIRED: 10-25-05\n\nNew. #8506, INTERIM, eff 12-7-05, EXPIRES: 6-5-06; ss and moved by #8617, eff 4-28-06, (from Saf-C 2308.09) EXPIRED: 1-21-15 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 2300)\n\nNew. #10787, eff 2-20-15; ss by #14321, eff 7-16-25, EXPIRES: 7-16-35",
